 "wishes": [
  "bowtie + foot on a stem (as 16a/17a/18a/18b), here with an inverted-triangle cup above it",
  "an elliptical ring: the two bottom lobes are stroked ellipses (encoded as 360-degree elliptical arcs; kept outside the mirror because a reflected full-circle arc renders with zero sweep)"
 ],
 "notes": "Bilaterally symmetric body: a large ring on top of a bar with small rings at its ends; a bracket-shaped outline each side running in to an inner post, each post with a ring and the two joined below by a U; a central stem carrying an inverted cup, a bowtie and a triangular foot; elliptical lobes and a ring at the bottom. From the body's right a thick handle rises to a comb of four parallel tines on a short bar with a spine."
